{"page":96,"targets":[{"kind":"law","label":"제371조","title":"민법 제371조","url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsSideInfoP.do?docCls=jo&joBrNo=00&joNo=0371&lsiSeq=284415&urlMode=lsScJoRltInfoR","status":"current","articleText":"제371조(지상권, 전세권을 목적으로 하는 저당권) ①본장의 규정은 지상권 또는 전세권을 저당권의 목적으로 한 경우에 준용한다.\n\n②지상권 또는 전세권을 목적으로 저당권을 설정한 자는 저당권자의 동의없이 지상권 또는 전세권을 소멸하게 하는 행위를 하지 못한다.\n\n","noteNumber":207,"line":15,"x":0.5953398,"y":0.6293406,"w":0.0627262,"h":0.0123626},{"kind":"case","label":"2013다91672","title":"판례 2013다91672","url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/precSc.do?menuId=7&query=2013%EB%8B%A491672","noteNumber":207,"line":15,"x":0.361398,"y":0.6293406,"w":0.1067102,"h":0.0123626},{"kind":"case","label":"2006다29372","title":"판례 2006다29372","url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/precSc.do?menuId=7&query=2006%EB%8B%A429372","noteNumber":207,"line":17,"x":0.1353786,"y":0.6753296,"w":0.1067103,"h":0.0123626},{"kind":"case","label":"2013다91672","title":"판례 2013다91672","url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/precSc.do?menuId=7&query=2013%EB%8B%A491672","noteNumber":210,"line":22,"x":0.2129709,"y":0.8017582,"w":0.1064772,"h":0.0123626},{"kind":"cross","label":"주124","title":"제출본 각주 124","number":124,"targetPage":57,"noteNumber":209,"line":20,"x":0.4007767,"y":0.751978,"w":0.0552163,"h":0.0123626},{"kind":"note","number":207,"targetPage":96,"label":"207)","title":"각주 207","x":0.5186796,"y":0.1203854,"w":0.0293546,"h":0.0113736},{"kind":"note","number":208,"targetPage":96,"label":"208)","title":"각주 208","x":0.7151068,"y":0.3086272,"w":0.0293546,"h":0.0113736},{"kind":"note","number":209,"targetPage":96,"label":"209)","title":"각주 209","x":0.8914951,"y":0.3086272,"w":0.0293546,"h":0.0113736},{"kind":"note","number":210,"targetPage":96,"label":"210)","title":"각주 210","x":0.4676505,"y":0.338792,"w":0.0293546,"h":0.0113736},{"kind":"note","number":207,"targetPage":96,"label":"207)","title":"각주 207 본문 위치","line":15,"x":0.1099806,"y":0.6293736,"w":0.026439,"h":0.0092308},{"kind":"note","number":208,"targe